    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490590/extras/9866ea0a9eb0c97c0c117f58d7f6d8ea.poster.avif?t=1748480195\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490590/extras/9866ea0a9eb0c97c0c117f58d7f6d8ea.webm?t=1748480195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Are you reading this? Hi! My name is <strong>Eva</strong>. I'm the main protagonist of the game you're looking at. Yes, this little platformer game is about <strong>me</strong>... About me AND dimensional travel! Do you want to know more?<br><br>Okay, well... I am a <i>(mostly)</i> peaceful creature living between different worlds. Sleeping is usually all I do, but right now, something evil is happening to said worlds, and I want it to stop. That's where I need you, for your ability to see in 2D... <i><strong>There's no time to explain!!!1</strong></i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DIMENSIONAL TRAVEL</h2>Play the game in multiple dimensions <strong>simultaneously</strong>, traveling through them at will!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490590/extras/fc819f9d60ceefb8b26b8785cfe11005.poster.avif?t=1748480195\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490590/extras/fc819f9d60ceefb8b26b8785cfe11005.webm?t=1748480195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NOT JUST DECORATIONS</h2>All worlds are <strong>truly</strong> different! One might not let you breathe, while the other will allow you to fly!..<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490590/extras/2c552635d2537a210118534cc7e4da58.poster.avif?t=1748480195\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490590/extras/2c552635d2537a210118534cc7e4da58.webm?t=1748480195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DYNAMIC LEVELS</h2>Each level <strong>changes</strong> whenever you fail! Say &quot;yes!&quot; to an ever-fresh experience!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490590/extras/0fe027586814e25dc5fca8d481432460.poster.avif?t=1748480195\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490590/extras/0fe027586814e25dc5fca8d481432460.webm?t=1748480195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FREEDOM OF MOVEMENT</h2>Make <strong>your</strong> way! And if it doesn't work, make another one.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490590/extras/7393edbd6cbcae1821c076eac8a5e8cd.poster.avif?t=1748480195\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490590/extras/7393edbd6cbcae1821c076eac8a5e8cd.webm?t=1748480195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">YOUR CHARISMATIC COMPANION</h2>The <strong>best</strong> playable character in the history of gaming <i>(according to herself)</i> will never leave you alone! EVER. <i>(guys, we should rewrite this - it sounds like a threat)</i><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490590/extras/ebf60ddf62a81330cb3f0ec1ee64db82.poster.avif?t=1748480195\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490590/extras/ebf60ddf62a81330cb3f0ec1ee64db82.webm?t=1748480195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490590/extras/9866ea0a9eb0c97c0c117f58d7f6d8ea.poster.avif?t=1748480195\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490590/extras/9866ea0a9eb0c97c0c117f58d7f6d8ea.webm?t=1748480195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>Are you reading this? Hi! My name is <strong>Eva</strong>. I'm the main protagonist of the game you're looking at. Yes, this little platformer game is about <strong>me</strong>... About me AND dimensional travel! Do you want to know more?<br><br>Okay, well... I am a <i>(mostly)</i> peaceful creature living between different worlds. Sleeping is usually all I do, but right now, something evil is happening to said worlds, and I want it to stop. That's where I need you, for your ability to see in 2D... <i><strong>There's no time to explain!!!1</strong></i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DIMENSIONAL TRAVEL</h2>Play the game in multiple dimensions <strong>simultaneously</strong>, traveling through them at will!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490590/extras/fc819f9d60ceefb8b26b8785cfe11005.poster.avif?t=1748480195\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490590/extras/fc819f9d60ceefb8b26b8785cfe11005.webm?t=1748480195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NOT JUST DECORATIONS</h2>All worlds are <strong>truly</strong> different! One might not let you breathe, while the other will allow you to fly!..<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490590/extras/2c552635d2537a210118534cc7e4da58.poster.avif?t=1748480195\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490590/extras/2c552635d2537a210118534cc7e4da58.webm?t=1748480195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DYNAMIC LEVELS</h2>Each level <strong>changes</strong> whenever you fail! Say &quot;yes!&quot; to an ever-fresh experience!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490590/extras/0fe027586814e25dc5fca8d481432460.poster.avif?t=1748480195\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490590/extras/0fe027586814e25dc5fca8d481432460.webm?t=1748480195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FREEDOM OF MOVEMENT</h2>Make <strong>your</strong> way! And if it doesn't work, make another one.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490590/extras/7393edbd6cbcae1821c076eac8a5e8cd.poster.avif?t=1748480195\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490590/extras/7393edbd6cbcae1821c076eac8a5e8cd.webm?t=1748480195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">YOUR CHARISMATIC COMPANION</h2>The <strong>best</strong> playable character in the history of gaming <i>(according to herself)</i> will never leave you alone! EVER. <i>(guys, we should rewrite this - it sounds like a threat)</i><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490590/extras/ebf60ddf62a81330cb3f0ec1ee64db82.poster.avif?t=1748480195\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490590/extras/ebf60ddf62a81330cb3f0ec1ee64db82.webm?t=1748480195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
    "short_description": "Play in multiple dimensions at the same time, traveling through them at will in this innovative 2D platformer that defies boundaries! I'm Eva, by the way, and I promise we'll have fun! Or maybe not... Maybe we'll both suffer horribly... How should I know? I'm just a video game character...",
    "supported_languages": "English, Ukrainian",
    "reviews": "\u201cWe are Eva gives you a different perspective on the platforming genre.\u201d<br>4.5 / 5 \u2013 Games Creed<br><br>\u201cThe moment you solve a seemingly impossible level, it\u2019ll feel like you executed a perfect dance \u2014 it\u2019s so satisfying!\u201d<br>9 / 10 \u2013 Alyssa Rochelle Payne, GameGrin<br><br>\u201cBest. Game. Ever!\u201d<br>10 / 10 \u2013 Eva<br>",
